{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>December 2025.</strong> Gleam City\u2019s lights burn bright, but something is wrong beneath the surface. You are Sarah Caldwell, a former military sharpshooter drawn into a night that begins with whispers\u2014and ends in screams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this atmospheric first-person horror shooter, the familiar turns hostile as the city descends into chaos. Armed only with your instincts and your rifle, you must navigate the shadows, survive the unknown, and uncover what\u2019s corrupting the streets you once knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920120/extras/giff.gif?t=1747002622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival-Focused Shooter Gameplay</strong>: Precision matters in tense, fast-paced combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Urban Horror Setting</strong>: Explore a dazzling city twisted by dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unfolding Mystery</strong>: Discover chilling secrets as the nightmare deepens.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gleam City is not what it seems. In <i>Radiant Exodus</i>, light won\u2019t save you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2920120?t=1747002622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920120/2a2560bc59333b9b7ea3dda863e32ceb72e44c33/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747002622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920120/af5e938fd66303b89ae05132e677c831be3b4c93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747002622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920120/af5e938fd66303b89ae05132e677c831be3b4c93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747002622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descri